 <h2 data-i18n="vH2Pool">Pool and deck</h2>
 <p data-i18n="vPPool">The infinity pool sits on the cliff edge, so the water line reads against the horizon rather than against a wall. Below and beyond it, the timber deck extends over the rock. It is the part of the villa guests use at both ends of the day — early, before the heat, and again after sunset, when the deck lighting comes up and the sea goes quiet.</p>
